  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CBI Cooperation Support for Cocoa Processing en Export</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With this intervention, the results, lessons-learned and successes of the OrangeCocoaPro (OCP) combi programme on local processing of cocoa will be scaled and further embedded in the local ecosystem.The Centre for the Promotion of Imports from developing countries (CBI) will work with a larger group of cooperatives in C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire (CDI), the &apos;second movers&apos;, and provide them with coaching and capacity building on market requirements, export processes, governance, access to finance and Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) requirements (such as EUDR).Thereby, this intervention will contribute to scaling the OrangeCocoaPro initiative and reaching systemic change in the Ivorian cocoa sector.</narrative>
  </description>
